# Upstream

Fork of [nicobailon/pi-web-access](https://github.com/nicobailon/pi-web-access) (MIT, © Nico
Bailon), taken at upstream tag **v0.10.7** = commit
`076bf0db5e739b200286ca37486e4edd8d19123c` (2026-05-02). Our history is squashed from there, so
updates from upstream are a manual port, not a merge.

**Byte-identical to upstream at the fork point:** `LICENSE`, `activity.ts`, `banner.png`,
`github-extract.ts`, `pdf-extract.ts`, `rsc-extract.ts`, `utils.ts`, `test/pdf-extract.test.mjs`.

**Modified by us:** `index.ts` (one `web` tool with `search` / `read` / `get` modes, simplified
prompts and schemas), `extract.ts`, `exa.ts`, `github-api.ts`, `storage.ts`.

**Added by us:** `search.ts`, `types.ts`, `TOOLS.md`.

Upstream has since grown past 110 files to v0.46.0 (2026-10-28). Reconciling with upstream is a
separate activity.
